## Watermark Table

You need somewhere to store the last processed value per table.

Create this table in a control database. For simplicity, you can create it in the same Oracle database as your app metadata.

```sql
CREATE TABLE DATA_READER_WATERMARK (
    ID NUMBER GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,
    DATABASE_NAME VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,
    TABLE_NAME VARCHAR2(200) NOT NULL,
    WATERMARK_COLUMN VARCHAR2(100) NOT NULL,
    WATERMARK_TYPE VARCHAR2(50) NOT NULL,
    WATERMARK_VALUE VARCHAR2(4000),
    UPDATED_AT TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,
    CONSTRAINT UK_DATA_READER_WATERMARK UNIQUE (
        DATABASE_NAME,
        TABLE_NAME,
        WATERMARK_COLUMN
    )
);
```

