## Better Production Table Config

Add a tie-breaker column.

```java
private String tieBreakerColumn;
private TableReaderProperties.WatermarkType tieBreakerType;
```

Example:

```yaml
reader:
  tables:
    - name: CUSTOMER_EVENTS
      database: customerDb
      schema: CUSTOMER_USER
      watermark-column: CREATED_AT
      watermark-type: TIMESTAMP
      tie-breaker-column: EVENT_ID
      tie-breaker-type: NUMBER
      processor: customerEventProcessor
      enabled: true
```

Recommended ordering:

```sql
ORDER BY CREATED_AT, EVENT_ID
```

Recommended filter:

```sql
WHERE CREATED_AT > :lastCreatedAt
   OR (
        CREATED_AT = :lastCreatedAt
        AND EVENT_ID > :lastEventId
      )
```

