## Example Processing Flow

```text
1. Scheduler starts.
2. App reads configured tables.
3. For CUSTOMER_EVENTS:
       a. Get last watermark.
       b. Query Oracle for newer rows.
       c. Send rows to customerEventProcessor.
       d. If processing succeeds, update watermark.
4. Repeat after polling interval.
```

