## Recommended Extension Points

| Extension Point | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `DataProcessor` | Add table-specific processing logic |
| `ReaderProperties.tables` | Add more tables without code changes |
| `ReaderProperties.databases` | Add more Oracle databases |
| `WatermarkRepository` | Move watermark storage to a central database |
| `QueryBuilder` | Support different query strategies |
| `TableReaderProperties` | Add selected columns, filters, composite keys, SCN support |
| `DataSourceRegistry` | Add dynamic database loading from external config |

