## If You Want the App to Process Inserts Almost Instantly

Polling is good for general-purpose processing, but if you need near real-time CDC, consider:

* Oracle GoldenGate
* Debezium with Oracle LogMiner
* Oracle AQ
* Database triggers writing to an outbox table
* Transactional outbox pattern

For most custom Spring Boot apps, the polling + watermark approach is the easiest and most maintainable starting point.

